  message: "Fixed in PR merged via auto-pr (commit 5e04e83e2). verify-claims now accepts --taint-sources/--taint-sinks/--taint-sanitizers (repeatable, file-or-dir) and an extra_catalogs: key in the claims YAML. Public helper load_full_taint_catalog() stacks auto-derived + built-in + user layers with override semantics preserved. One-line stderr summary surfaces override application. Spec §11 updated."  # ecc8
